# Frontend (`frontend/`)

- Vite + React. API base: `VITE_API_BASE` or `/api`. Prefer WebSocket `ChatSocket` (`/ws/chat`); SSE and POST `/chat` are fallbacks.
- Types for attachments and stream handlers live in `types.ts` / `api.ts`. Do not call a deploy-approve endpoint — the API does not have one. Leftover `pendingDeploy` / `approveDeploy` is dead; remove or wire only if you add HITL in the graph.
- Prompts admin token: `X-Prompts-Token` from localStorage (`ai-coworker.prompts-token`).
- Keep chat, attachments (PDF/PNG/JPEG), and the prompts panel working together. Application state (`threadId`) must stay consistent across those views.

```ts
// BAD
await fetch("/api/threads/" + id + "/approve-deploy", { method: "POST" });

// GOOD
socket.sendChat({ message, thread_id: threadId, attachments });
```
